{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06444","headline":"圣善阁送裴迪入京 · 李颀","name":"圣善阁送裴迪入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云华满高阁，苔色上鈎栏。\n药草空阶静，梧桐返照寒。\n清吟可愈疾，携手暂同欢。\n堕叶和金磬，饥乌鸣露盘。\n伊流惜东别，灞水向西看。\n旧托含香署，云霄何足难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}